⚠️ Problem: static path mismatch

You have:

alias /static/;

But Docker mounts:

- ./static:/static:ro

AND Django uses:

STATIC_ROOT = BASE_DIR / "staticfiles"

👉 So your real collected static files are NOT in /static/

FIX

Change nginx to:

location /static/ {
    alias /app/staticfiles/;
}

And update docker:

- ./static:/app/staticfiles

OR better:

👉 mount STATIC_ROOT instead:

- ./staticfiles:/app/staticfiles